"<li><b>%a</b> - gets replaced with the \"Artist token\"</li>\n"
"<li><b>%A</b> - gets replaced with the \"Album token\"</li>\n"
"<li><b>%T</b> - gets replaced with the \"Track token\"</li>\n"
"<li><b>%c</b> - gets replaced with the \"Comment token\"</li></ul></qt>"
